## ⚙️ Processes & Jobs
```bash
ps aux              # List all processes
top                 # Real-time process viewer
htop                # Enhanced viewer (if installed)
pgrep name          # Find process IDs
pkill name          # Kill by process name
kill PID            # Kill by PID
killall name        # Kill all matching processes
nice -n 10 cmd      # Run with priority
renice -n 10 -p PID # Change priority
jobs                # Show background jobs
bg %1               # Resume in background
fg %1               # Bring to foreground
nohup cmd &         # Run in background (ignore hangups)
time cmd            # Measure execution time
watch -n 1 free     # Run command repeatedly
```

