## 💽 Disk & Filesystem
```bash
df -h                # Disk usage
du -sh dir/          # Directory size
lsblk                # Block devices
blkid                # Device attributes
fdisk -l             # Partition list
parted -l            # Partition details
mkfs.ext4 /dev/sdX1  # Format partition
fsck /dev/sdX1       # Check filesystem
mount /dev/sdX1 /mnt # Mount partition
umount /mnt          # Unmount
cat /etc/fstab       # Auto-mount config
```

