## 🌐 Networking & DNS
```bash
ip addr              # Show IP address
ip route             # Routing table
ping -c 4 host       # Connectivity test
traceroute host      # Trace route
ss -tuln             # Open ports
netstat -tuln        # Legacy port list
nslookup example.com # DNS lookup
dig example.com      # Detailed DNS query
curl -I URL          # HTTP request
wget URL             # Download file
ssh user@host        # Remote login
scp file user@host:/path/  # Copy over SSH
sftp user@host       # File transfer
nc -l -p 1234        # Listen on port
nc host 80           # Connect to port
tcpdump -i eth0 port 443 # Packet capture
nmap -sS host        # Port scan
ufw enable           # Enable firewall
ufw allow 22         # Allow SSH
iptables -L          # Firewall rules
firewall-cmd --list-all # Firewalld config
```

