## 📦 Archiving & Compression
```bash
tar -czf file.tar.gz dir/   # Create tar.gz
tar -xzf file.tar.gz        # Extract tar.gz
tar -cf file.tar dir/       # Create tar
tar -xf file.tar            # Extract tar
zip -r file.zip dir/        # Create zip
unzip file.zip              # Extract zip
gzip file                   # Compress
gunzip file.gz              # Decompress
bzip2 file                  # Compress
bunzip2 file.bz2            # Decompress
xz file                     # Compress
unxz file.xz                # Decompress
rsync -avz src/ dest/       # Sync files
rsync -avz -e ssh src/ user@host:/dest/  # Remote sync
cpio -ov < filelist > archive.cpio       # Create archive
```

