## 📦 Package Management

### Debian / Ubuntu
```bash
apt-get update        # Update package list
apt-get install pkg   # Install package
apt-get upgrade       # Upgrade packages
apt-get remove pkg    # Remove package
apt-cache search pkg  # Search package
apt-cache show pkg    # Package info
dpkg -i pkg.deb       # Install .deb
dpkg -r pkg           # Remove package
```

### RHEL / CentOS / Fedora
```bash
yum install pkg
yum update
yum remove pkg

dnf install pkg
dnf update

rpm -i pkg.rpm
rpm -e pkg
```

